description.text:
One single piercing ranged hybrid attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if the user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Earth;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Earth Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, Damage +50% & Casting Speed x1.3 to Earth Abilities] to user

